<h4>Example working Array code</h4>

Max Array Entry: <input type=number 
    id="myText01" value="3"><br>
    
<input type=button value="Example" onClick="{
    let myTemp= document.getElementById('myText01').value
    let mySum=''
    document.getElementById('myDiv01').innerHTML=''
    
    
    myArray = new Array()
    myArray[0]= 'Fred'
    myArray[1]='Mary'
    myArray[2]='Lizzy'
    
    for (let myLoop=0; myLoop < myTemp; myLoop++){
        mySum += 'Loop #: ' + myLoop + ' array entry: ' + myArray[myLoop] +'<br>'
    }
    document.getElementById('myDiv01').innerHTML = mySum
}">

<div id="myDiv01">...</div>
<br>

You do more arrays that do different thing,hopefully some with numbers.<br>
